48. **Delete local .md/.docx mirrors of Google Docs after upload/PATCH.** GDoc is always ground truth. Never use a persisted local file as a PATCH source — always export from the GDoc first, edit the export, PATCH back, then delete the local copy. Applies to document prose only; code, data, JSON, CSV are fine to keep. Supersedes any prior "keep local mirror in sync" instructions. Set by KP 2026-04-17 11:12 EDT. → [feedback_no_local_doc_mirrors.md](projects/-home-ubuntu/memory/feedback_no_local_doc_mirrors.md)

