+Fix round 1 complete.
+
+Changed docs/physics.js: preserve instant hard dome crashes; add Hull crushed
+after more than 0.6 cumulative seconds of inverted (>95 degrees wrapped)
+ground/ceiling dome contact within a rolling 1.5-second window; add Stranded
+after more than 2.5 continuous seconds bodyGrounded with both wheels off ground
+and |vx| < 15 px/s. Brief contact and upright recovery remain possible.
+
+Changed docs/terrain.js and physics.js: no active vents in the first 220 m
+(first vent begins at 242 m), base lift 465 -> 232.5 px/s^2, scaling linearly
+from x1.0 at 220 m to x1.5 at 1500 m, capped thereafter. Chassis and wheels
+receive equal vent acceleration. First vent airtime measured at 1.392 s.
+AirControl reduced by 20% for every vehicle. A level-0 ramp test completes a
+backflip and lands upright after 4.242 s of hang; browser flip bonuses pass.
+
+Test 2: level-0 Reef Rover, 40 simulated seconds per stage after the game's
+normal 1.5 s settling period, 120 Hz fixed steps. Throttle 0.9 s / coast 0.3 s;
+when airborne and wrapped angle < -35 degrees, replace throttle with a 0.15 s
+brake tap, repeating if correction is still needed. No crash clearing, oxygen
+refills, upgrades, ballast, or pickups during the timed runs.
+
+Coral Reef:           977.5 m — RUNNING
+Kelp Forest:          916.5 m — RUNNING
+Shipwreck Graveyard:  758.8 m — RUNNING
+Volcanic Vents:       815.9 m — RUNNING
+Ice Shelf:            886.1 m — RUNNING
+Abyssal Trench:       791.0 m — RUNNING
+
+Validation passed:
+- node --check on every JS/CJS file; git diff --check.
+- node docs/selftest.js: 27/27 checks, including window expiration/accumulation,
+  wrapped-angle threshold, ceiling contact, brief recovery, slow dome death,
+  stranded ledge, equal vent acceleration/scaling, all six QA runs, and flip.
+- Same 27/27 checks in real headless Chromium loading file://docs/selftest.html;
+  same measured distances; no page errors or external requests.
+- node tests/progression.test.js: 13/13 progression/audio suites.
+- node tests/edge.test.cjs: passes, including a motionless inverted dome rest
+  ending after 0.608 simulated seconds and real GAMEOVER/HULL CRUSHED output.
+- node tests/browser.test.cjs: desktop/mobile integration passes; zero app
+  console errors/warnings or external requests. Both browser launchers now use
+  pipe:true, with file:// and no listening ports. Chromium required permission
+  to run outside the workspace sandbox for its internal process communication.
+
+README.md game-over rules, vent description and testing updated; Fix round 1
+appended to STATUS.md. Existing file names and docs/game.js AR.inspect QA
+fields are preserved. No deployment performed.
